      "language": "undefined",
      "value": "This property associates an instance of E13 Attribute Assignment with the instance of E1 CRM Entity about which it made an attribution. The instance of E1 CRM Entity plays the role of the domain of the attribution.\nThe kind of attribution made should be documented using P177 assigned property of type (is type of property assigned).",
