      "identifier": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment",
      "language": "undefined",
      "value": "This property describes the CRM Entities documented as instances of E31 Document.\nDocuments may describe any conceivable entity, hence the link to the highest-level entity in the CIDOC CRM class hierarchy. This property is intended for cases where a reference is regarded as making a proposition about reality. This may be of a documentary character, in the scholarly or scientific sense, or a more general statement.",
